Subject: [PATCH 27/27] TUI footer cleanup + sessions/subagents split pills
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

User feedback: footer was cluttered. Drop:
  - Directory (cwd path)
  - Mcp (MCP server count)
  - Version (opencode version)
  - BackgroundTasks (subsumed by Subagents — bg children appear in
    the live set when their session is being tracked, so the live
    subagents pill already covers them)

Replace single LiveSessions pill with two pills powered by the new
LiveSessionsChanged.subagents field:

  ● N sessions   (root sessions live = sessions.length - subagents.length)
  ● N subagents  (live subagents = subagents.length)

Final footer layout: Sessions, Subagents, HivemindStatus, flex-grow
spacer. Same View rendered into both home_footer and session_footer
slots so it's visible everywhere.

Initial values come from GET /global/live-sessions on mount; updates
flow via the bus event. No polling, no per-render DB hits.
